# Erebus Grid: Cold Storage, track 3 (SPEC 19.8). The volcano: along the
# rim road and down the east flank (a long rise and dip), along the foot
# past the fumaroles (a steam vent), then up the switchbacks through the
# geothermal plant (its grated deck, a steam vent) into the switchyard,
# where arcs flash between the pylons across the road (two blasts on the
# yard's timer), and back down to the line. Black rock, ash, orange dashes.
name EREBUS GRID
order 3
floor rock
background basalt
centerline yes
league cold_storage
width 50
# x    y    half   features
 280  150   54                     # start line, heading east
 520  140   54     crates
 760  150   52
 890  240   50
 910  420   48     hill            # over the flank
 900  640   48
 860  820   50
 700  890   50     crates
 480  890   50     vent:right,period=300,warn=50,phase=100   # a fumarole's steam
 300  890   50
 150  850   52
 110  760   50
 180  690   48
 400  700   46     shadow,len=30   # the plant's grated deck
 580  700   46     vent:left,period=280,warn=50   # its steam vent
 720  680   46
 760  590   46
 680  520   46
 520  520   46     vent:right,period=240,warn=45,phase=60    # arc flash between the pylons
 380  520   46     vent:left,period=240,warn=45,phase=180    # and again
 260  470   48
 220  350   50
 220  230   52
# Props: the switchyard's pylons, the plant's pipes and crane, radar on
# the rim, turbines on the ridge.
props pylon seg 17 side both gap 60 off 22
props pylon seg 18 side both gap 60 off 22
props pipe,crane seg 13 side right gap 80 off 24
props radar,turbine seg 1 side left gap 90 off 26
props turbine seg 4 side right gap 90 off 26
props pipe seg 8 side left gap 90 off 24
